{"id":"hundred-color-shell","name":{"en":"Hundred Color Shell","ja":"百色貝の貝がら","sc":"百色贝的贝壳","tc":"百色貝的貝殼"},"desc":{"en":"The colors of this shell change depending on how light hits it, hence the name. It's commonly given as a gift, making beautiful hair ornaments and brooches.","ja":"光の当たり方によって様々に色を変えることから、この呼称がつけられた百色貝の貝がら。髪飾りやブローチにして贈り物に"},"level":3,"evalue":15,"water":true,"effect":50,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"crystal-valley","name":{"en":"Crystal Valley","ja":"結晶渓谷"},"parent":"eastern-continent"},{"id":"hidden-cave","name":{"en":"Hidden Cave","ja":"秘められし洞窟"},"parent":"eastern-continent"},{"id":"tunnel-of-plants","name":{"en":"Tunnel of Plants","ja":"植物坑道"},"parent":"unexplored-lands"}],"categories":[{"id":"animal","name":{"en":"(Animal)","ja":"（動物素材）"},"icon":"category-animal"}],"index":69,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_MULTI_COLOR_SHELL"}